cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article."
title: "Verification and figure code for: Hidden symmetry at the diabolical points of a biaxial spin"
abstract: >-
  A single self-contained Python program that generates the five figures of the
  article and, in --verify mode, recomputes the quantitative claims listed in
  the README from the definition of the model, compares them with the
  manuscript source and fails on any discrepancy. Version 1.1.0 refers to the
  revised manuscript submitted to Physical Review B.
type: software
